# Cross-origin isolation headers for hosts that honour this file
# (Netlify, Cloudflare Pages). Our service worker adds COOP/COEP to the
# responses it serves; this file isolates the very first, uncached load so
# SharedArrayBuffer (multi-threaded WASM) is available immediately.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: credentialless
